    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Shatterlands \u2014 a forgotten world where the ruins of Earth meet ancient magic.</strong><br>Gravebound is a post-apocalyptic shooter extraction game that fuses fast-paced gunplay with light survival mechanics and dark fantasy elements. Explore shattered cities, scavenge powerful gear, and face off against other players and deadly creatures in a high-stakes fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path \u2014 hunt for rare artifacts, engage in tense firefights, or strike deals with factions. But every run comes with a choice: push deeper for greater rewards or extract before the Shatterlands consume you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooter Extraction Gameplay</strong><br>Load in solo or with a squad. Scavenge, fight, and extract \u2014 or risk it all for the best loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Apocalyptic Fantasy World</strong><br>Explore the Shatterlands \u2014 a unique setting where crumbling cities, corrupted forests, and magical ruins collide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Gunplay Meets Fantasy Powers</strong><br>Wield modern firearms alongside ancient relics and mystical abilities that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvPvE Combat</strong><br>Face off against other players and AI-controlled monsters and bosses \u2014 every encounter is a deadly choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction Reputation System</strong><br>Loot gear and turn it in to factions for rewards, upgrades, and unique gear. Build alliances or make enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk-Reward Extraction</strong><br>Extract safely or dive deeper for the most powerful loot \u2014 but beware, death means losing everything you carry.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Shatterlands \u2014 a forgotten world where the ruins of Earth meet ancient magic.</strong><br>Gravebound is a post-apocalyptic shooter extraction game that fuses fast-paced gunplay with light survival mechanics and dark fantasy elements. Explore shattered cities, scavenge powerful gear, and face off against other players and deadly creatures in a high-stakes fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path \u2014 hunt for rare artifacts, engage in tense firefights, or strike deals with factions. But every run comes with a choice: push deeper for greater rewards or extract before the Shatterlands consume you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooter Extraction Gameplay</strong><br>Load in solo or with a squad. Scavenge, fight, and extract \u2014 or risk it all for the best loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Apocalyptic Fantasy World</strong><br>Explore the Shatterlands \u2014 a unique setting where crumbling cities, corrupted forests, and magical ruins collide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Gunplay Meets Fantasy Powers</strong><br>Wield modern firearms alongside ancient relics and mystical abilities that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvPvE Combat</strong><br>Face off against other players and AI-controlled monsters and bosses \u2014 every encounter is a deadly choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction Reputation System</strong><br>Loot gear and turn it in to factions for rewards, upgrades, and unique gear. Build alliances or make enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk-Reward Extraction</strong><br>Extract safely or dive deeper for the most powerful loot \u2014 but beware, death means losing everything you carry.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Gravebound is a post-apocalyptic extraction shooter set in a world where crumbling cities and ancient magic collide. Fight, loot, and survive against deadly creatures and rival players as you explore the Shatterlands.",
